### Define multiple windows in tauri.conf.json

Source: https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri-docs/blob/v2/src/content/docs/learn/Security/capabilities-for-windows-and-platforms.mdx

Configure multiple webview windows statically within the app.windows array of tauri.conf.json. Each window requires a unique label along with initial attributes.

```javascript
  "productName": "multiwindow",
  ...
  "app": {
    "windows": [
      {
        "label": "first",
        "title": "First",
        "width": 800,
        "height": 600
      },
      {
        "label": "second",
        "title": "Second",
        "width": 800,
        "height": 600
      }
    ],
  },
  ...
}
```
